WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.230
In 2020, China's census counted a
floating population of 375.8 million.

2
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:11.460
That counts people who live away from
where their household is registered.

3
00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:15.570
124.8 million had crossed
a provincial border.

4
00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:21.270
Every July, the World Bank sorts
218 economies into 4 income groups.

5
00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:22.990
So where does China sit?

6
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:23.670
Rich?

7
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:24.410
Poor?

8
00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:25.770
Or impossible to measure?

9
00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:29.510
In this mission, you'll
classify countries by income,

10
00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:33.370
then build the Human Development
Index from its three dimensions.

11
00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:38.370
You'll also see why two UN estimates
of Jakarta's 2025 population,

12
00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:43.270
about 12 million and about
42 million, differ so much.

13
00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:47.330
Your mission: decide whether China
is a rich country or a poor one,

14
00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.010
and justify your answer.
